      "writtenOn": "2024-11-19T18:02:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be nice if we guaranteed an order here to signal preference of decreasing codec efficiency. Today we do not have that data, but could order by types appearing in sCodecList - so at least the order is consistent on the device between reboots. By convention, sCodecList puts video codecs first, which is not balanced, but that\u0027s probably okay.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 66,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 68,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "d507eb112c74344f9a2238145fdf2942a2d6e5d1",
